==Battleground==
*3 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*3 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ghost Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
**3 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn, delay 12~16.67 seconds<sup>360f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

